<title>USA: PS Group sets special dividend.</title>
<headline>PS Group sets special dividend.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>PS Group Holdings Inc Friday set a special cash dividend of $1.50 a share payable August 28 to shareholders of record as of August 18.</p>
</text>
